        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While I was still in prison in the courtyard, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s message came to me again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", who made the earth, who formed it and set it in place, spoke to me. He whose name is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Call to me, and I will answer you; I will tell you wonderful and marvellous things that you know nothing about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, say that the houses of Jerusalem and the royal palace of Judah will be torn down as a result of the siege and the attack. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some will fight against the Babylonians, who will fill the houses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33.4–5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "In verses 4 and 5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "as a result",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "houses",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with the corpses of those whom I am going to strike down in my anger and fury. I have turned away from this city because of the evil things that its people have done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will heal this city and its people and restore them to health. I will show them abundant peace and security. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make Judah and Israel prosperous, and I will rebuild them as they were before. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will purify them from the sins that they have committed against me, and I will forgive their sins and their rebellion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalem will be a source of joy, honour, and pride to me; and every nation in the world will fear and tremble when they hear about the good things that I do for the people of Jerusalem and about the prosperity that I bring to the city.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
