        {
          "text": "the shouts of gladness and joy and the happy sounds of wedding feasts. You will hear people sing as they bring thank-offerings to my Temple; they will say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
