            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “The time is coming when I will fulfil the promise that I made to the people of Israel and Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time I will choose as king a righteous descendant of David. That king will do what is right and just throughout the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Judah and of Jerusalem will be rescued and will live in safety. The city will be called ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Our Salvation’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
